  "releaseNotes": "3.3.0 — Added IDiagnosticSink, a dependency-free hook for the SDK's internal warnings (dropped/truncated stream blocks, an abandoned-after-timeout tool call that later failed) — wire via Engine.Options.Diagnostics / EngineBuilder.WithDiagnostics; unset keeps writing to Console.Error as before. Shell hooks can now veto a call before it spawns (ShellExecution.VetoResult). Fixed a CancellationTokenSource leak when a tool-call timeout raced an outer cancellation.",
